From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] winprint, splwow64: a job printed through the printer's Windows driver; 32-bit programs through our 64-bit host

A program's pages reach the spooler as metafiles (NT EMF), and winprint
handled only RAW and TEXT jobs: a printer with a Windows driver could not
print. winprint now plays an EMF job through the printer's graphics driver
as GDI does -- DrvEnableDriver, DrvEnablePDEV, DrvEnableSurface, per page
DrvStartPage, the page drawn into the driver's surface by GDI's engine,
DrvSendPage (or band by band, DrvStartBanding/DrvNextBand), DrvEndDoc --
and the driver's EngWritePrinter output goes to the printer's port as the
job's raw data. Drivers are 64-bit on a 64-bit system; a 32-bit program
(DYMO Connect's helpers, most label software) cannot load them. As Windows
does with its splwow64, such a job is run by splwow64.exe, our 64-bit host,
on a copy of the job, and winprint sends what it wrote. splwow64 also
measures a page for a 32-bit program's DC; run by the Windows system, it
readies every printer's driver for every user and installs the makers'
staged packages (splwow64 drivers); and for Linux programs printing through
a Windows driver (sg-session's sgwindrv CUPS backend) it lists such
printers, makes a PPD from a driver's capabilities (its papers with their
printable areas, resolutions, colour) and prints page images through it.

Test: test/printdrv-gate.sh, 64- and 32-bit (mutants SG_MUTANT_EMFPROC,
SG_MUTANT_WOWHOST); test/linuxdrv-gate.sh, a Linux program's PDF through a
CUPS queue of its own and the sgwindrv backend (mutant SG_MUTANT_HOSTPRINT).
---
--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -1746,6 +1746,7 @@ enable_setx
 enable_shutdown
 enable_snippingtool
 enable_sort
+enable_splwow64
 enable_spoolsv
 enable_start
 enable_subst
@@ -23224,6 +23225,7 @@ wine_fn_config_makefile programs/setx enable_setx
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/shutdown enable_shutdown
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/snippingtool enable_snippingtool
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/sort enable_sort
+wine_fn_config_makefile programs/splwow64 enable_splwow64
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/spoolsv enable_spoolsv
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/start enable_start
 wine_fn_config_makefile programs/subst enable_subst
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -3538,6 +3538,7 @@ WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/setx)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/shutdown)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/snippingtool)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/sort)
+WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/splwow64)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/spoolsv)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/start)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(programs/subst)
--- a/dlls/winprint/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/winprint/Makefile.in
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 MODULE    = winprint.dll
-IMPORTS   = winspool
+IMPORTS   = winspool gdi32 user32
 
 SOURCES = \
+	emf.c \
 	printproc.c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/winprint/emf.c
@@ -0,0 +1,640 @@
